I removed the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the linker refuses anything outside it. A stated intent to widen the grant in a later release does not change what can be linked now. Once the graph definition grants `http-client`, the fetch can be added back. Because the fetch result was never used, the node's output is the same as before.

